t may require your warband to ally itself with old enemies against this new threat.<br><br><strong>Rally your friends, raid your enemies, protect your tribe*</strong><br>Hundreds of players are present at the same time in Rise. Your movements and battles are present in real-time; there are no instances in the world. Your actions make a mark in the world. The more people you bring to your side, the bigger your actions are.<br><br>* To be added after Early Access",
